<projectDescription>
	<name>ThreadX_STM32F0308_KvbSuite</name>
	<comment>KVB benchmark suite on Eclipse ThreadX for STM32F0308-DISCO board.  Sibling of TaktOS_STM32F0308_KvbSuite and FreeRTOS_STM32F0308_KvbSuite — same shared platform/test set, ThreadX swapped for the kernel under test.</comment>
